k that there  might be a good fit for targeting both  white grubs and root weevils in  strawberries with that new insecticide  I think on that far yet I don't have to  call up the company and ask if they'd be  interested are there any other questions  for either gym or rich  well thank you everyone for  participating and again I would ask if  you would please just take five minutes  go to the exit survey and fill it out  for us we would be greatly appreciative  have a wonderful strawberry season and  we hope you'll join us for the next  webinar series thanks  you  you  you  you  you
 

